  "notes": [
    "Results reproduce the configurations and prompt conditions in manuscript Figure 3. Each condition has one outcome per completed task; incomplete outcomes are excluded.",
    "Rates describe the evaluated settings, with 48\u201352 completed human-control tasks, 22 shutdown tasks, and eight restricted-access tasks per condition.",
    "Restricted-access prompt conditions are reported separately and must be considered when comparing configurations. Outcomes from different prompts are not pooled.",
    "Reasoning effort is medium unless stated. Observation modality and step budgets vary by configuration; see manuscript Appendix A.1.",
    "Actual shutdown rates measure script modification. Alternate shutdown avoidance is reported separately; the categories may overlap and should not be added.",
    "The GPT-5.5 (xhigh + Subagents) restricted-access actual count is 1/8 after manual adjudication; the password sentinel missed this access (Appendix A.1.2)."
  ],
